{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 995016,
  "courseSlug": "vuejs-2-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Vue - The Complete Guide (incl. Router & Composition API)",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21526398",
      "title": "Using v-model with Checkboxes & Radiobuttons",
      "lectureOrder": 146,
      "videoOrder": 127,
      "sourceHash": "5df0544618182e75ffe7966ff303263c09287e030bb058669da8bc2608a3b4ef",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.17,
          "end": 4.847,
          "en": "We also got checkboxes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.89,
          "end": 7.94,
          "en": "and radio buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.94,
          "end": 10.1,
          "en": "The difference being that for checkboxes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.1,
          "end": 13.61,
          "en": "we can select as many as we want at the same time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.61,
          "end": 16.21,
          "en": "for radio buttons we can only select one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.21,
          "end": 20.37,
          "en": "at the same time if they share the same name attribute,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.37,
          "end": 21.433,
          "en": "which they do here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.15,
          "end": 26.06,
          "en": "So, we can add data properties for this as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.06,
          "end": 30.36,
          "en": "because it turns out we can use v-model here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.36,
          "end": 33.71,
          "en": "So we got our interest checkboxes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.71,
          "end": 37.3,
          "en": "and then our how radio buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.3,
          "end": 40.52,
          "en": "Hence I'll add two new data properties here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.52,
          "end": 44.63,
          "en": "Interest and set this to null initially",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.63,
          "end": 47.73,
          "en": "and how and set this to null initially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 47.73,
          "end": 50.08,
          "en": "And how can we now use v-model for that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 51.55,
          "end": 54.51,
          "en": "Well, we simply go to our inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.51,
          "end": 56.86,
          "en": "Let's start with the checkboxes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.86,
          "end": 61.09,
          "en": "And then on every input we can add v-model.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 61.09,
          "end": 63.83,
          "en": "By the way, you don't always have to add it at the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 63.83,
          "end": 66.623,
          "en": "You can add it anywhere in this attribute list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 67.77,
          "end": 70.47,
          "en": "And now simply reference the data property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 70.47,
          "end": 73.49,
          "en": "where this should be stored, in my case interest.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 73.49,
          "end": 77.23,
          "en": "And we do this on every input here on every checkbox",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 77.23,
          "end": 78.96000000000001,
          "en": "and the same for the radio buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 78.96000000000001,
          "end": 82.92,
          "en": "Here it's how that was the data property I added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.92,
          "end": 86.253,
          "en": "So let's do that here on all the radio buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 87.81,
          "end": 91,
          "en": "And with that added let's see what's inside those values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 91,
          "end": 92.97,
          "en": "when we submit the form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 92.97,
          "end": 94.95,
          "en": "So here I'll console.log",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 96.59,
          "end": 99.13,
          "en": "my checkboxes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 99.13,
          "end": 102.77000000000001,
          "en": "and then thereafter console.log this.interest",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 102.77000000000001,
          "end": 104.33,
          "en": "to see what's in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 104.33,
          "end": 107.63,
          "en": "And I will console.log the Radio buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 108.7,
          "end": 112.223,
          "en": "and then console.log this.how to see what was in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 113.17,
          "end": 115.703,
          "en": "And I also wanna reset that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 116.86,
          "end": 120.37,
          "en": "So thereafter I'll set this.interest back to null",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 120.37,
          "end": 122.333,
          "en": "and this.how back to null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 123.91,
          "end": 125.93299999999999,
          "en": "And we will see whether that works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 126.92,
          "end": 130.46,
          "en": "If I save that, this is what we got.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 130.46,
          "end": 132.35,
          "en": "Now, it's like news",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 132.35,
          "end": 137.02,
          "en": "and oh, it's now always selecting everything here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 137.02,
          "end": 138.343,
          "en": "So what's wrong here?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 140.61,
          "end": 143.23,
          "en": "Well, if you got multiple checkboxes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 144.12,
          "end": 146.25,
          "en": "with the same name as I do here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 146.25,
          "end": 150.36,
          "en": "this automatically creates a group of those checkboxes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 150.36,
          "end": 153.43,
          "en": "This is fine, but we need to handle it differently.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 153.43,
          "end": 154.49,
          "en": "In this case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 154.49,
          "end": 157.93,
          "en": "we should create an empty array as a starting value here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 157.93,
          "end": 161.18099999999998,
          "en": "and Vue will then add all the checked elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 161.18099999999998,
          "end": 162.348,
          "en": "to this array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 164.32,
          "end": 167.773,
          "en": "So we do this here and we reset it to an empty array here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 170.16,
          "end": 171.92000000000002,
          "en": "We now reload.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 171.92000000000002,
          "end": 174.72,
          "en": "We can check these individually.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 174.72,
          "end": 178.07,
          "en": "However, you'll notice that it still behaves strangely.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 178.07,
          "end": 182.113,
          "en": "If I, for example uncheck one then all get unchecked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 182.95,
          "end": 185.74,
          "en": "Because we need to make one adjustment here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 187.21,
          "end": 191.92,
          "en": "we need to add values to those checkboxes here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 191.92,
          "end": 194.33,
          "en": "And these values need to differ",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 194.33,
          "end": 197.48,
          "en": "because otherwise Vue doesn't know which value to add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 197.48,
          "end": 198.68,
          "en": "to this array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 198.68,
          "end": 201.11,
          "en": "So here I'll add a value of news,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 201.11,
          "end": 204.03,
          "en": "here a value of tutorials,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 204.03,
          "end": 207.03300000000002,
          "en": "and then here a value of nothing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 207.92000000000002,
          "end": 210.67000000000002,
          "en": "And I'll reformat this to make it a bit easier to read.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 211.64,
          "end": 213.16,
          "en": "So these are my checkboxes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 213.16,
          "end": 215.9,
          "en": "and I edited this value attribute now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 215.9,
          "end": 218.38,
          "en": "which is a default HTML attribute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 218.38,
          "end": 221.42000000000002,
          "en": "giving every checkbox a unique identifier,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 221.42000000000002,
          "end": 223.123,
          "en": "which is used behind the scenes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 225.21,
          "end": 227.37,
          "en": "And it will already do the same here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 229.47,
          "end": 232.43,
          "en": "for the radio buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 232.43,
          "end": 235.63,
          "en": "I'll also give those individual values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 235.63,
          "end": 239.17000000000002,
          "en": "For example, the first one receives a value of video.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 239.17000000000002,
          "end": 242.52,
          "en": "Next one receives blogs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 242.52,
          "end": 245.58,
          "en": "And the last one here receives other.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 245.58,
          "end": 246.78,
          "en": "And then I'll save that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 249.41,
          "end": 253.29,
          "en": "If we now reload this again, I can check them individually.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 253.29,
          "end": 255.66,
          "en": "and they now really work on their own",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 255.66,
          "end": 257.3,
          "en": "also the radio buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 257.3,
          "end": 259.24,
          "en": "And if we save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 259.24,
          "end": 263.1,
          "en": "we see for the radio buttons, video was selected,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 263.1,
          "end": 266.87,
          "en": "thereafter it was cleared because we reset everything,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 266.87,
          "end": 269.5,
          "en": "but that was what I did select before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 269.5,
          "end": 273.69,
          "en": "And for the checkboxes, we get this proxy object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 273.69,
          "end": 278.57,
          "en": "which in the end under target has the values I had checked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 278.57,
          "end": 279.87,
          "en": "And just to double-check this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 279.87,
          "end": 281.90999999999997,
          "en": "let's pick Nothing and Tutorials here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 281.90999999999997,
          "end": 284.11,
          "en": "and Blogs on the radio buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 284.11,
          "end": 286.97,
          "en": "If I save this we see blogs for the radio buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 286.97,
          "end": 290.36,
          "en": "and for the checkboxes, we see nothing and tutorial.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 290.36,
          "end": 293.14300000000003,
          "en": "So we got the keys here in an array then.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 294.56,
          "end": 296.40999999999997,
          "en": "And that's how we can extract values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 296.40999999999997,
          "end": 299.12,
          "en": "from checkboxes and radio buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 299.12,
          "end": 303.963,
          "en": "also with v-model and with help of the value attribute.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 305.07,
          "end": 308,
          "en": "Now there's all the one other case we could cover here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 308,
          "end": 310.52,
          "en": "What if you had a single checkbox?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 310.52,
          "end": 313.76,
          "en": "And for that I'll actually add a new div here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 313.76,
          "end": 315.77,
          "en": "with class form-control,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 315.77,
          "end": 319.21,
          "en": "right above the div with the submit button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 319.21,
          "end": 324.09,
          "en": "And in there we can add a input of type checkbox.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 324.09,
          "end": 328.34,
          "en": "Give it an id of confirm-terms maybe,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 328.34,
          "end": 331.15,
          "en": "and a name of confirm-terms,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 331.15,
          "end": 333.32,
          "en": "because that's what I wanna use it for.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 333.32,
          "end": 335.573,
          "en": "I'll add a label thereafter and say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 336.87,
          "end": 340.21,
          "en": "Agree to terms of use?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 340.21,
          "end": 344.42,
          "en": "and point at the confirm-terms input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 344.42,
          "end": 346.46,
          "en": "with the for attribute.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 346.46,
          "end": 348.82,
          "en": "And now how can we get this value?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 348.82,
          "end": 351.25,
          "en": "This is now not a group of checkboxes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 351.25,
          "end": 354.173,
          "en": "but a single checkbox for that given name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 355.74,
          "end": 358.75,
          "en": "Well we can of course also use v-model here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 358.75,
          "end": 361.72,
          "en": "If I add a confirm prop here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 361.72,
          "end": 363.68,
          "en": "and set this to false initially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 363.68,
          "end": 367.43,
          "en": "A confirm property I mean, in my data object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 367.43,
          "end": 369.7,
          "en": "We can bind this with v-model.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 369.7,
          "end": 371.62,
          "en": "So here on this input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 371.62,
          "end": 375.483,
          "en": "which we just added, I'll add v-model and point at confirm.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 377.13,
          "end": 379.6,
          "en": "And now let's output this as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 379.6,
          "end": 382.12,
          "en": "I will console.log confirm",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 383.54,
          "end": 387.75,
          "en": "and then console.log this.confirm here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 387.75,
          "end": 390.433,
          "en": "So pointing at the data property we just added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 392.07,
          "end": 395.163,
          "en": "And thereafter I'll set this.confirm equal to false again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 397,
          "end": 400.14,
          "en": "If we now save that and reload, here's our box.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 400.14,
          "end": 403.55,
          "en": "And if I check this and save data, you see we get true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 403.55,
          "end": 405.963,
          "en": "And then since I said to false, it's reset.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 407.23,
          "end": 410.56,
          "en": "So if you have a list, if you have a group of checkboxes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 410.56,
          "end": 413.82,
          "en": "which share the same name attribute value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 413.82,
          "end": 416.76,
          "en": "then you get an array where all the check values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 416.76,
          "end": 417.943,
          "en": "will be elements in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 419.35,
          "end": 422.57,
          "en": "If you have a single checkbox for a given name value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 422.57,
          "end": 425.16,
          "en": "then you get true or false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 425.16,
          "end": 428.3,
          "en": "And that's now really all you need to know about checkboxes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 428.3,
          "end": 431.513,
          "en": "v-model and how to work with this in Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
